          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/cat-harness/skill/before-after-preview",
          "@type": "bootstrap:Skill",
          "ambiguous": false,
          "description": "Make a reviewer-facing BEFORE/AFTER preview of a change to anything that is rendered — a docs site, a paper's PDF, a FHIR IG, a slide deck, a website — and put it where the review and feedback processes expect it. Covers one build with one variable, stable capture, pairing every picture with a measured count and its method, the viewports and colour schemes to shoot, an honest status line, publishing with alt text, a section per content type naming this repository's own build and render tools, and how reviewer feedback on the preview becomes beans. Use before asking anyone to review a rendered change, at the HCI validation gate, and whenever a reviewer asks \"what did it look like before\".",
